# Authentication

Requests reach the load balancer first. The balancer forwards each request to the API gateway, which asks the auth service to check the token.

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  A[Browser] --> B[Load balancer] --> C[API gateway] --> D[Auth service]
```

The browser receives the response once the auth service and the API gateway agree on the token, and then it sends the response back to the user.
